    "Id": "mechdef_timberwolf_TW-TC",
    "Name": "Timber Wolf -- Mad Cat",
    "Details": "The Timber Wolf is a fast, heavy OmniMech. A signature design of the Clans' military might, it was arguably the first Clan OmniMech encountered by Inner Sphere forces on The Rock in 3049 by Phelan Kell. When first encountered by Inner Sphere forces the idea that a heavy 'Mech could move so swiftly while being as heavily armed and armored as the Timber Wolf was inconceivable. A highly maneuverable configuration of the Timber Wolf, the TC mounts five jump jets. For firepower, the TC configuration mounts two each Large Pulse Lasers, ER Medium Lasers, and Streak SRM-6s, with a lone ER Small Laser as the sole concession to point-blank combat.",
